{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2dc394dc2d1f148c2c4c91052a2c1f46b9f923b085ec5910f6c4592ca04823ee", "ja": "ど、どうしたんだ真？　いきなり奇声をあげて……！", "zh": "怎、怎么啦，真？突然发出怪声……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0033_1002_006mak", "source_sha256": "c4cda80da481f5744dde1983e1b6790ccf3e9623dee16affdb63e34c940e8aa7", "ja": "うわあっ、{$P$}、いたんですか！？\nくう～、恥ずかしいなあ！", "zh": "呜哇，{$P$}，原来你在啊！？\n呜～好丢脸喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0033_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "2d2dc5284e4dac88da34895f06c1846b6fbbfc6bddb265e2858d54c682a608ef", "ja": "実は、その……この前やった、テーマパークでの\n仕事を思い出してて……へへっ♪", "zh": "其实是，那个……\n我回想起了之前在主题乐园做的工作……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0033_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4cb7d805fd1da74d1c27caea83d53eb371f5c6fb057ecfab7548a4a2406455f9", "ja": "ああ、真がパレードの、お姫様役をやったやつか？", "zh": "喔，是真在游行中扮演公主的工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0033_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "a823153a7fde940134b8f2f5de57c3cf9c269c8cf2c3dee5bd4c811e4fe4d717", "ja": "それです！　ボクが、あんなに可愛い仕事を\nやらせてもらえるなんて、感激しちゃって……。", "zh": "就是那个！居然能让在下参与那么可爱的工作，\n真是太感激了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0033_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "064ffb5213162db9c76c8f7682f78fbc556571392e85088712a2e40e7f382bf3", "ja": "それに、{$P$}とも仕事の前に、\nこう、一緒に……えへへへへ～♪", "zh": "而且在工作之前，还能和{$P$}\n像这样待在一起……嘿嘿嘿嘿～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0033_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "b3b5e4a1315aed2055f1161b60d3757284b3a18760b95321bf17efe26193bc3b", "ja": "そうだっ！　また、ああいうテーマパークでの仕事、\n来てませんか？　ボク、はりきってやりますよ！", "zh": "对了！还有再接到那种主题乐园的工作吗？\n在下会全力以赴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0033_1008_p", "source_sha256": "49a03f57824815968d184a43574b508072300828f44cdb4cea4a428929a3fd33", "ja": "テーマパークの仕事か……。\nうーん、今だと一件、なくはないかな。", "zh": "主题乐园的工作啊……\n嗯～目前算是有一件吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0033_1009_006mak", "source_sha256": "3c285859548734acdda9628d4234ffeea40a07069e72c70d0ef33d77289b12ea", "ja": "ホントですか！？　やります、やります！", "zh": "真的吗！？在下要做，在下要做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0033_1010_p", "source_sha256": "34afd215df4de7a72c5c0d093107fdd1d64a7da38be047a526ff2caad73b0c7a", "ja": "でも、ヒーローショーの、\n着ぐるみ怪人の役だけど。いいのか？", "zh": "不过，是要在英雄秀里\n穿布偶装饰演怪人喔，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0033_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "419f3e8002453c76bc02c454ecab7948b7f5d65f55cc5ae38a33513214a7d44a", "ja": "えっ。着ぐるみ怪人……。\nそっか、ヒーローですらないのか……。", "zh": "咦，穿布偶装演怪人……\n这样啊，居然连英雄都不是吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0033_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "75183667bb5e6ce09f304420022fbde2672fd14ee3af2249c75845b713ab5fa8", "ja": "ま、まあ、いいですよ、やります！\nいえ、やらせてください！", "zh": "算、算了，没关系，在下要做！\n不，拜托给在下这个机会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0033_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "ef77224e4f7395c7b9a412da1c41d4f60e818b88df3fa027dfc500cae19e6288", "ja": "頑張りますから、その……また仕事の前に、一緒に\nアトラクションに乗ってくださいね！　えへへ♪", "zh": "在下会加油的，所以那个……在工作前，\n我们再一起去搭游乐设施吧！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
